ectations, even outdoing the original Little Nightmares with its mature themes, twists on the formula, and genuinely tense and scary gameplay.”<br>10\/10 – Try Hard Guides<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2129530\/4cdda917a0155258a2e7909d7869f35d8f980f96\/header.jpg?t=1784646020","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2129530\/0e28f1b3446dd979013ca3df83a3ced5d7ca611b\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784646020","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2129530\/0e28f1b3446dd979013ca3df83a3ced5d7ca611b\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784646020","website":"https:\/\/reanimal.thqnordic.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Ryzen 5 2400G \/ Core i5-9400F<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1060 \/ Radeon RX 480<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 12<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 18 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>64비트 프로세서와 운영 체제가 필요합니다<br><\/li><li><strong>운영 체제:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11<br><\/li><li><strong>프로세서:<\/strong> Ryzen 5 3600X \/ Core i7-7700KTBD<br><\/li><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>그래픽:<\/strong> GeForce RTX 2060 \/ Radeon RX 6600XTTBD<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> 버전 12<br><\/li><li><strong>네트워크:<\/strong> 초고속 인터넷 연결<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 18 GB 사용 가능 공간<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/s